The set $\{ \mathfrak{f}_3(x), \mathfrak{f}_4(x) \}$ is warranted with certificate $(-37937620,$ $0,$ $0,$ $-29081,$ $-5816)$.
However, $\mathfrak{f}_3(x)$ and $\mathfrak{f}_4(x)$ are not Seidel-compatible.
Hence we can consider Seidel-compatibility with $\mathfrak{f}_3(x)$ and $\mathfrak{f}_4(x)$ separately.
From the 53 interlacing characteristic polynomials $\operatorname{Char}_S(x)$, only three are Seidel-compatible with $\mathfrak{f}_3(x)$:
\begin{align*}
    \mathfrak{f}_3(x) &= (x+5)^{31} (x-9)^{11} (x-11)^2 (x^4-34x^3+404x^2-1966x+3323), \\

